      "updated_at": "2016-08-02T07:14:17Z",
      "body": "Both cleanflight and prior to that baseflight uses this kind of platform for configuration. One benefit with this approach is it makes the development platform independent. Until we find a better suitable platform-independent solution I think this is how it is going to be for a while. \n\nDo you have any better suggestions? Anyone are able to make PR to this repository and suggest changes so if you have something good going already then please share your work/ideas to start the discussion. \n",
